# Defense-in-depth against dependency-confusion attacks (security audit FIND-DEP-03).
#
# The @fsrs-japanese scope is private to this monorepo and is never published
# to a public registry. All references resolve via Bun's workspace protocol
# (workspace:*). This .npmrc routes any accidental external resolution of
# @fsrs-japanese/* to a non-existent registry so it fails loudly instead of
# silently fetching a same-named package an attacker could publish to npmjs.
#
# Reserve the @fsrs-japanese scope on npmjs.com to make this protection
# unconditional; until then, this is the workspace-local guard.
@fsrs-japanese:registry=https://no-such-registry.invalid/
